cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this repository helps you, you may cite it as below. It is an informal,
  work-in-progress synthesis of published research, written with Claude, an AI
  assistant by Anthropic. It is not an official standard, not peer-reviewed,
  and not a new result.
title: "ai-augmented-project (work in progress)"
abstract: >-
  How a person, a language model and a machine are set up and run one project together: what the machine checks, what the model is given and may do, what stays the person's, and the loop between the three. Scope only; the review is not started.
type: software
authors:
